# Plain gameplay: a real generated level, flown and shot. No composed set
# piece — this is the "what is the game actually like" clip, and it is the
# one most feeds want. Generation 5 is the sweet spot: the specials have
# unlocked (reflective, teleporting, invisible, quantum) so the field has
# variety, but the world is still small enough to stay busy on screen.
#
# Default rotate camera, unlike the composed scenes: this is the view a
# player actually has, and the world swinging around the ship is a good part
# of how the game reads in motion.
# Thrust in pulses rather than `hold w` — held thrust just accelerates away
# and leaves the rocks behind. The gun is automatic, so fire is held.
seed 73
sim 600
frames 110
fps 30
size 960 540
hud off
game 5
hold space
key w 700
key w 1100
key d 1600
key w 2100
key a 2700
key w 3000
key w 3400
